  "notes": [
    "Pilot SPM93 multifunction meter: the common real-time block (40001-40033), the full real-time block (40101-40144) and the energy block (41001-41032).",
    "The manual numbers registers from 40001, so address 0 is 40001. 32-bit values are low word first (word order little). Function 03.",
    "The over-voltage and under-voltage timing registers (40146, 40147), the historical records (41201 onwards) and the configuration registers are not in this map.",
    "RTU, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit. Not tested on a device."
  ],
